step 5
add n10:
    if nums[m] == target:
        return m
    elif nums[m] < target:
        left = m
    else:
        right = m - 1
expect gaps GAP003
or
add n10:
    if nums[m] == target:
        return m
    if nums[m] < target:
        left = m
